{'symbol': 'GOOG', 'date': '2023-05-05 10:30:00', 'title': 'GOOG, GOOGL INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD ALPHABET INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES EXCEEDING $100,000 ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM. \xa0 LOS ANGELES , MAY 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ("GPM") ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST ALPHABET INC. ("ALPHABET" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: GOOG, GOOGL).'}